WEBVTT

00:13:28.776 --> 00:13:32.308
That there is hope
dealing with this epidemic.

00:13:32.911 --> 00:13:37.376
Our current overdoses are down 40 percent.

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:44.800
(Applause)

00:13:45.878 --> 00:13:49.172
Currently, our overdose deaths
are down 50 percent.

00:13:49.529 --> 00:13:54.175
(Applause)

00:13:54.199 --> 00:13:56.762
This epidemic is far from over.

00:13:56.786 --> 00:14:01.609
But each and every one of us
has a part to play in this epidemic.